{"id":"dae33bf8749d6f9d","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-hilbert-system.md","title":"Hilbert System","display":"df-hilbert-system — Hilbert System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-hilbert-system","aliases":["72-df-hilbert-system"],"display":"df-hilbert-system — Hilbert System","depends_on":["[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","[[72-df-theory-proof]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §§1.1.2,2.2.1 print5,29/PDF17,41; explicit equivalent classical axiom presentation","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-hilbert-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-hilbert-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hilbert-system — Hilbert System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f5f45b7be0b2d491\" href=\"?note=f5f45b7be0b2d491\" title=\"72-df-theory-proof\">72-df-theory-proof</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §§1.1.2,2.2.1 print5,29/PDF17,41; explicit equivalent classical axiom presentation"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-hilbert-system-—-Hilbert-system\">df-hilbert-system — Hilbert-system</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\Sigma\">\\(X_\\Sigma\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a>。以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_H\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_H\\)</span> 采用明确的经典命题公理模式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim A\">\\(\\sim A\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to\\bot\">\\(A\\to\\bot\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\leftrightarrow B\">\\(A\\leftrightarrow B\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A)\">\\((A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in X_\\Sigma\">\\(A,B\\in X_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>。本Hilbert演算只给纯逻辑规则，不包含额外逻辑相等公理；在含等号理论中它们须显式添加。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 只含句子，故概括规则没有自由临时前提。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Ax}_H:=\\{\\top\\}&amp;\\cup\\{A\\to(B\\to A),(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)),\\sim\\sim A\\to A:A,B,C\\in X_\\Sigma\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{D\\to E,E\\to D:A,B\\in X_\\Sigma,\\ \\langle D,E\\rangle\\in\\{\\langle\\neg A,\\sim A\\rangle,\\langle A\\land B,\\sim(A\\to\\sim B)\\rangle,\\langle A\\lor B,\\sim A\\to B\\rangle\\}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\forall xA\\to A[t/x]:A\\in X_\\Sigma,x\\in V,t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma),\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\forall x(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):A,B\\in X_\\Sigma,x\\in V,x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{D\\to E,E\\to D:A\\in X_\\Sigma,x\\in V,D=\\exists xA,E=\\sim\\forall x\\sim A\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf R_H&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle A,A\\to B\\rangle,B\\rangle:A,B\\in X_\\Sigma\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle A\\rangle,\\forall xA\\rangle:A\\in X_\\Sigma,x\\in V\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Hilb}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\langle X_\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Ax}_H,\\mathsf R_H\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{HilbertProofSystem}(\\mathcal H,\\Sigma)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal H=\\mathrm{Hilb}_\\Sigma.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Ax}_H:=\\{\\top\\}&amp;\\cup\\{A\\to(B\\to A),(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)),\\sim\\sim A\\to A:A,B,C\\in X_\\Sigma\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{D\\to E,E\\to D:A,B\\in X_\\Sigma,\\ \\langle D,E\\rangle\\in\\{\\langle\\neg A,\\sim A\\rangle,\\langle A\\land B,\\sim(A\\to\\sim B)\\rangle,\\langle A\\lor B,\\sim A\\to B\\rangle\\}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\forall xA\\to A[t/x]:A\\in X_\\Sigma,x\\in V,t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma),\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\forall x(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):A,B\\in X_\\Sigma,x\\in V,x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{D\\to E,E\\to D:A\\in X_\\Sigma,x\\in V,D=\\exists xA,E=\\sim\\forall x\\sim A\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf R_H&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle A,A\\to B\\rangle,B\\rangle:A,B\\in X_\\Sigma\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle A\\rangle,\\forall xA\\rangle:A\\in X_\\Sigma,x\\in V\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Hilb}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\langle X_\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Ax}_H,\\mathsf R_H\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{HilbertProofSystem}(\\mathcal H,\\Sigma)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal H=\\mathrm{Hilb}_\\Sigma.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>消除旧条把Hilb预设为一个未知P_Hilbert再断言其正确性的循环。实际有限推导用theory-proof的无解除序列接口；它与带标签树的编码不同，须通过具体模拟而非字面识别连接。命题公理及各联结词定义模式均以显式集合给出，不使用未编码的TautInst或全一阶有效式作公理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-hilbert-system-—-Hilbert-system","text":"df-hilbert-system — Hilbert-system","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-theory-proof","status":"resolved","id":"f5f45b7be0b2d491","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-theory-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X_\\Sigma$ 见 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]]。以下 $\\mathsf{Ax}_H$ 采用明确的经典命题公理模式；$\\sim A$ 缩写 $A\\to\\bot$。$A\\leftrightarrow B$ 缩写 $(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A)$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ax}_H","display":false},{"tex":"\\sim A","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"A\\leftrightarrow B","display":false},{"tex":"(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A)","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in X_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Ax}_H:=\\{\\top\\}&\\cup\\{A\\to(B\\to A),(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)),\\sim\\sim A\\to A:A,B,C\\in X_\\Sigma\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{D\\to E,E\\to D:A,B\\in X_\\Sigma,\\ \\langle D,E\\rangle\\in\\{\\langle\\neg A,\\sim A\\rangle,\\langle A\\land B,\\sim(A\\to\\sim B)\\rangle,\\langle A\\lor B,\\sim A\\to B\\rangle\\}\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\forall xA\\to A[t/x]:A\\in X_\\Sigma,x\\in V,t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma),\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\forall x(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):A,B\\in X_\\Sigma,x\\in V,x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{D\\to E,E\\to D:A\\in X_\\Sigma,x\\in V,D=\\exists xA,E=\\sim\\forall x\\sim A\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf R_H&:=\\{\\langle\\langle A,A\\to B\\rangle,B\\rangle:A,B\\in X_\\Sigma\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle A\\rangle,\\forall xA\\rangle:A\\in X_\\Sigma,x\\in V\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Hilb}_\\Sigma&:=\\langle X_\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Ax}_H,\\mathsf R_H\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{HilbertProofSystem}(\\mathcal H,\\Sigma)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal H=\\mathrm{Hilb}_\\Sigma.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2438,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-hilbert-system|df-hilbert-system — Hilbert System]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-hilbert-system|df-hilbert-system — Hilbert System]]"}],"outgoing":["3c073b947b255638","5c014dab66d624c8","f5f45b7be0b2d491"]}